            "value": "Il manque encore une réponse."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es fehlt noch eine Antwort."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is an admin account, so your answers are not counted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dit is een beheerdersaccount, dus je antwoorden tellen niet mee."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ceci est un compte administrateur, vos réponses ne sont donc pas comptées."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies ist ein Administratorkonto, Ihre Antworten zählen daher nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please wait a moment and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Even wachten en dan opnieuw proberen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Patientez un instant et réessayez."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einen Moment warten und noch einmal versuchen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We could not find your account. Open the link from the email, or sign in first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We konden je account niet vinden. Open de link uit de e-mail, of log eerst in."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous n’avons pas trouvé votre compte. Ouvrez le lien de l’e-mail, ou connectez-vous d’abord."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir konnten Ihr Konto nicht finden. Öffnen Sie den Link aus der E-Mail, oder melden Sie sich zuerst an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thank you, we have your answers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bedankt, we hebben je antwoorden."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Merci, nous avons vos réponses."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Danke, wir haben Ihre Antworten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This genuinely decides what we build next.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dit bepaalt echt wat we hierna bouwen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela décide vraiment de ce que nous construirons ensuite."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das entscheidet wirklich, was wir als Nächstes bauen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What could be better?": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wat kan er beter?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qu’est-ce qui pourrait être mieux ?"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was könnte besser sein?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have already answered the questions, thank you. Anything you write here comes straight to us.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je hebt de vragen al beantwoord, dank je. Alles wat je hier schrijft komt rechtstreeks bij ons terecht."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez déjà répondu aux questions, merci. Tout ce que vous écrivez ici nous parvient directement."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie haben die Fragen bereits beantwortet, danke. Alles, was Sie hier schreiben, kommt direkt bei uns an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thank you, we read every one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dank je, we lezen alles."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Merci, nous lisons tout."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Danke, wir lesen alles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add something else": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nog iets toevoegen"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajouter autre chose"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch etwas hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subject, briefly": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Onderwerp, kort"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Objet, en bref"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Betreff, kurz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What did not work, what was missing, or what went well?": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wat werkte niet, wat miste je, of wat viel juist mee?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qu’est-ce qui n’a pas marché, qu’est-ce qui manquait, ou qu’est-ce qui allait bien ?"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was hat nicht funktioniert, was hat gefehlt, oder was lief gut?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sending failed. Please try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Versturen lukte niet. Probeer het nog eens."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’envoi a échoué. Réessayez."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Senden fehlgeschlagen. Bitte noch einmal versuchen."
          }
        }
      }
